er s\u00e5dan automatisk, optimal og sikker beslutningstagning stadig udfordrende. Klassiske teknikker for at beregne sikre planer er i vid udstr\u00e6kning baseret p\u00e5 teknikker der evaluerer ydelsen af en astronomisk m\u00e6ngde af alternative planer. S\u00e5danne teknikker er langsomme eller uanvendelige p\u00e5 grund af de mange kr\u00e6vede beregninger. Vi har derfor brug for automatiske og mere informerede m\u00e5der at guide planl\u00e6gningsprocessen. I ConAn projektet sigter vi efter at introducere en ny tilgang til planl\u00e6gning, en der imitere m\u00e5den hvorp\u00e5 mennesker t\u00e6nker. Vi foresl\u00e5r at agenter foretager valg ved at vurdere fordele og ulemper af alternative planer i stedet for at evaluere dem enkeltvist. Med denne tilgang vil vi udvikle algoritmer og v\u00e6rkt\u00f8jer der garanterer at de beregnede eksekveringsplaner er sikre og optimale."}],"lead-investigator":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-5352-2529","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Alvaro","family":"Torralba Arias De Reyna","affiliation":[{"name":"Aalborg Universitet, SLV300"}]}],"award-amount":{"amount":6192000.0,"currency":"DKK"},"award-start":{"date-parts":[[2024,9,1]]},"award-end":{"date-parts":[[2028,8,31]]},"funding":[{"type":"grant","scheme":"Sapere Aude: DFF-Forskningsleder","award-amount":{"amount":6192000.0,"currency":"DKK","percentage":null},"funder":{"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100004836","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}],"name":"Independent Research Fund Denmark"}}]}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2026,3,27]],"date-time":"2026-03-27T14:08:10Z","timestamp":1774620490000},"score":25.09088,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/grants.forskningsportal.dk\/search?s=3120-00063A"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2024,9,1]]},"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.46540\/3120-00063b"},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2022,4,2]],"date-time":"2022-04-02T18:21:59Z","timestamp":1648923719547},"reference-count":0,"publisher":"JSTOR","issue":"10","content-domain":{"domain"